DeltaView extras
================

compare-with-deltaview
    A script for GNOME Files (Nautilus), Nemo and Caja that opens the
    selected folders or files in DeltaView. It is not installed into the
    file manager automatically. To enable it in Nautilus:

        mkdir -p ~/.local/share/nautilus/scripts
        ln -s /opt/delta_view/extras/compare-with-deltaview \
              ~/.local/share/nautilus/scripts/"Compare with DeltaView"

    Nemo looks in ~/.local/share/nemo/scripts and Caja in
    ~/.config/caja/scripts. The script's header and docs/command-line.md
    in the repository (https://github.com/Dhiva-Labs/Delta_view) have the
    details, including git difftool and mergetool setup.
